  "vibe": "Charcoal mat #1e2024 under a six-sticker cube palette — cube yellow #ffcb2e, blue #3d7bff, white #f4f4f6 over near-black #141518. Russo One squares off every uppercase title; Geologica sets the data. The backdrop is a 3×3 cube drawn isometrically, top face and left face, all eighteen tiles re-picking a sticker colour on separate clocks so the cube visibly scrambles in place; a ghosted 6.42-style timer runs at 16% white behind the type, five move notations R U' F2 D L' light one at a time on a 2.5Hz step, and a blue bar breathes underneath from 30% to 100%. Statement beats flash full yellow, the CTA floods blue. The camera is the hardest of any pack — 7× with a spin, 4° skew — and it is the only one where titles and items both slam in from 2.2× scale. Mechanics: keycap presses, a dial grid, tri-speed tickers, a circular dial.",
